{
    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. For every phone in the scene, there is a specific corresponding arrangement of five other objects: a shoe is located to the left of the phone, and a hat is positioned to the left of the shoe. Additionally, a book is placed above the phone, a calculator is above the shoe, and a camera is above the hat. The book, calculator, and camera are all situated on the top side of the image.",
